          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "SP 81 SE         ASTON CLINTON              LONDON ROAD                                             north side 5/14                                        No. 74 Prospect House _ _                                           II House. C18 altered, brick now covered with roughcast, old tile roof with large central chimney having 4 diagonal shafts with oversailing heads. Overhanging eaves with wood modillions. 2-storeys and attic, 2 bay front, sash windows in reveals, large canted bay of sash windows to RH, central shallow panelled door with simple flat hood. 2-light casement window to each floor in LH gable, horizontal sliding type to attic. Listing NGR: SP8820511987"
    }
